  "notes": "Each action must be granted by an Allow statement, and policy_all_resources requires that same statement to cover all resources, so a scoped resource fails only that check. The action checks are not bound to the named policy, so that a wrong name fails only policy_name; the prompt asks for one policy, so two policies splitting the claims is not expected."
